---
interface Props {
  brandName: string;
  accentColor: string;
  protocolSummary: string;
  routeSummary: string;
  egressRegions: string;
  isVerifiedPath?: boolean;
}

const {
  brandName,
  accentColor,
  protocolSummary,
  routeSummary,
  egressRegions,
  isVerifiedPath = false,
} = Astro.props;
---

<section class="obs-panel" style={`--accent: ${accentColor};`} aria-label={`${brandName} 网络路径示意图`}>
  <div class="obs-panel__head">
    <div>
      <div class="obs-panel__eyebrow">NETWORK PATH OBSERVATORY · CONCEPTUAL TOPOLOGY</div>
      <h3 class="obs-panel__title">{brandName} 接入与路由架构示意图</h3>
    </div>
    <span class="npo-badge">
      {isVerifiedPath ? '已核验实测路由' : '官方线路示意 · 未核验实际物理路径'}
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="npo-flow" role="img" aria-label={`${brandName} 接入拓扑示意图：本地终端经加密协议连接入口节点，再按资料宣称路径转至海外落地`}>
    <div class="npo-node">
      <div class="npo-node__tag">STEP 01 · CLIENT</div>
      <strong>用户终端设备</strong>
      <span>桌面 / 移动 / 软路由</span>
    </div>
    <div class="npo-link">
      <span class="mono">{protocolSummary}</span>
      <div class="npo-line"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="npo-node">
      <div class="npo-node__tag">STEP 02 · INGRESS</div>
      <strong>宣称接入/中转段</strong>
      <span>{routeSummary}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="npo-link">
      <span class="mono">跨境传输段（未独立 traceroute 验证）</span>
      <div class="npo-line npo-line--dashed" style={`border-color: ${accentColor};`}></div>
    </div>
    <div class="npo-node">
      <div class="npo-node__tag">STEP 03 · EGRESS</div>
      <strong>海外落地出口</strong>
      <span>{egressRegions}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="obs-note">
    技术声明：此图为基于品牌文字资料绘制的逻辑示意图，并非对该品牌物理跨境电路的实测证明。不可凭“公网 IP”或“原生 IP”直接等同为物理 IEPL/IPLC 专线。
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .npo-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.16);
    color: #fcd34d;
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
  }
  .npo-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .npo-flow {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1.2fr auto 1fr;
    }
  }
  .npo-node {
    background: var(--obs-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--obs-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 0.85rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }
  .npo-node__tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: #93c5fd;
  }
  .npo-node strong {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
  .npo-node span {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--obs-text-muted);
  }
  .npo-link {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--obs-text-muted);
    min-width: 110px;
  }
  .npo-line {
    width: 100%;
    height: 2px;
    background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.5);
  }
  .npo-line--dashed {
    height: 0;
    background: transparent;
    border-top: 2px dashed;
  }
</style>
